    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird RPG 2 is an innovative third-person action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game revolves around monster hunting, loot collection, and Boss challenges. A variety of unique equipment and items will help you defeat powerful Bosses, explore the unknown, and embrace every battle full of challenges and opportunities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Transformation System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique combat state! After transforming, players gain exceptional perception and precise targeting abilities, enjoying a whole new perspective on combat. On the battlefield, you can use ranged firepower, lock on to enemies with accuracy, and easily handle various combat scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/3b2f136e517f3e1913a7f9a74c0f2df9.poster.avif?t=1740488986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/3b2f136e517f3e1913a7f9a74c0f2df9.webm?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/3b2f136e517f3e1913a7f9a74c0f2df9.mp4?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Parry Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > At the core of the combat system is parrying. The parry system is designed to be very friendly, with forgiving timing requirements, allowing players to easily master and enjoy the swordplay. Challenge and fun go hand in hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/92b88ffc0f8176bd55caa7e836782df7.poster.avif?t=1740488986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/92b88ffc0f8176bd55caa7e836782df7.webm?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/92b88ffc0f8176bd55caa7e836782df7.mp4?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Voice-Controlled Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Voice-controlled gear is activated by microphone volume. Players can control powerful spell attacks based on the volume levels, creating a unique combat experience that blends sound and magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/87502f2b65bfbfe92e2e3d8c15405b8b.poster.avif?t=1740488986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/87502f2b65bfbfe92e2e3d8c15405b8b.webm?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/87502f2b65bfbfe92e2e3d8c15405b8b.mp4?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Unknowns and Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game is filled with unknowns and challenges! You'll face monsters of all shapes and sizes, with new surprises at every turn. Unique and unpredictable equipment and items will alter the course of battle, offering endless possibilities. Explore a mysterious world, unlock powerful gear, and face unprecedented challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/3989f546a9d021deeab82edd139add89.poster.avif?t=1740488986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/3989f546a9d021deeab82edd139add89.webm?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/3989f546a9d021deeab82edd139add89.mp4?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is crafted for players who crave to break the norm and seek new and exciting combat experiences. It\u2019s more than just a game; it's a journey filled with surprises and unknowns, waiting for you to explore. Every challenge may overturn your expectations, offering a fresh experience and discovery.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird RPG 2 is an innovative third-person action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game revolves around monster hunting, loot collection, and Boss challenges. A variety of unique equipment and items will help you defeat powerful Bosses, explore the unknown, and embrace every battle full of challenges and opportunities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Transformation System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique combat state! After transforming, players gain exceptional perception and precise targeting abilities, enjoying a whole new perspective on combat. On the battlefield, you can use ranged firepower, lock on to enemies with accuracy, and easily handle various combat scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/3b2f136e517f3e1913a7f9a74c0f2df9.poster.avif?t=1740488986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/3b2f136e517f3e1913a7f9a74c0f2df9.webm?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/3b2f136e517f3e1913a7f9a74c0f2df9.mp4?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Parry Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > At the core of the combat system is parrying. The parry system is designed to be very friendly, with forgiving timing requirements, allowing players to easily master and enjoy the swordplay. Challenge and fun go hand in hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/92b88ffc0f8176bd55caa7e836782df7.poster.avif?t=1740488986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/92b88ffc0f8176bd55caa7e836782df7.webm?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/92b88ffc0f8176bd55caa7e836782df7.mp4?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Voice-Controlled Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Voice-controlled gear is activated by microphone volume. Players can control powerful spell attacks based on the volume levels, creating a unique combat experience that blends sound and magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/87502f2b65bfbfe92e2e3d8c15405b8b.poster.avif?t=1740488986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/87502f2b65bfbfe92e2e3d8c15405b8b.webm?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/87502f2b65bfbfe92e2e3d8c15405b8b.mp4?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Unknowns and Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game is filled with unknowns and challenges! You'll face monsters of all shapes and sizes, with new surprises at every turn. Unique and unpredictable equipment and items will alter the course of battle, offering endless possibilities. Explore a mysterious world, unlock powerful gear, and face unprecedented challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/3989f546a9d021deeab82edd139add89.poster.avif?t=1740488986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/3989f546a9d021deeab82edd139add89.webm?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516470/extras/3989f546a9d021deeab82edd139add89.mp4?t=1740488986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is crafted for players who crave to break the norm and seek new and exciting combat experiences. It\u2019s more than just a game; it's a journey filled with surprises and unknowns, waiting for you to explore. Every challenge may overturn your expectations, offering a fresh experience and discovery.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Weird RPG&quot; Sequel. An innovative third-person action RPG where you battle monsters with traditional weapons or unleash spells using voice-controlled equipment. Equipment abilities change based on your computer\u2019s hardware. Join now and unleash your voice!",
